        <common:reviewDetails xml:lang="en">The dataset is compliant to "Zampori L., Pant R.: Suggestions for updating the Product Environmental Footprint (PEF) method, 2019 and Fazio S., Zampori L., De Schryver A. et al.: Guide for EF compliant data sets, Version 2.0, 2020.&#13;
In the PEF context the fields "Methodological appropriateness and consistency" and "completeness" are not evaluated by the review since their good quality is defined as mandatory.</common:reviewDetails>
